Files derived from djev-run, and modified by scripts in this repository (patch_demos.py):
  djev-patched/server.py    public gateway, audit log, empty-thinking answer canvas fix,
                            request ids, /lab route, generic error messages
  djev-patched/snake.html   live-model-only calls, no simulated fallback, shared nav, new styling
  djev-patched/tetris.html  as above, plus readable placement descriptions; engine originally from
                            trungdq88/jev-tetris (https://github.com/trungdq88/jev-tetris)
  djev-patched/dino.html    as above, plus the benchmark comparison removed; game originally from
                            virajbhartiya/laya-vs-jev (https://github.com/virajbhartiya/laya-vs-jev)
The main changes are listed in README.md ("How it works").

Model weights: nvidia/diffusiongemma-26B-A4B-it-NVFP4 (https://huggingface.co/nvidia/diffusiongemma-26B-A4B-it-NVFP4),
downloaded at deploy time under their own license; they are not included in this repository.
